{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02097",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.56,
      "end_seconds": 4.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Okay, hello, sorry about the delay, do sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.01,
      "end_seconds": 6.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Hi, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.4,
      "end_seconds": 9.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "What's the main thing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.22,
      "end_seconds": 21.54,
      "duration_seconds": 10.32,
      "text": "Ah, it's itchy red patches that have gone crusty. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.26,
      "end_seconds": 25.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.35,
      "end_seconds": 30.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "About... well, about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.86,
      "end_seconds": 39.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.81,
      "end_seconds": 50.3,
      "duration_seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "It's a couple of times a week. Maybe a eight out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.28,
      "end_seconds": 54.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.44,
      "end_seconds": 62.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "So, when it starts I tend to get being irritable as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.54,
      "end_seconds": 75.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "What about eating poorly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.95,
      "end_seconds": 79.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Definitely no eating poorly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.5,
      "end_seconds": 84.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Okay, go on. And what about drowsiness, high fever or blisters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.4,
      "end_seconds": 89.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "So, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.94,
      "end_seconds": 93.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.03,
      "end_seconds": 98.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "No, you know, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.56,
      "end_seconds": 103.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.21,
      "end_seconds": 120.1,
      "duration_seconds": 11.89,
      "text": "Uh, um, yes, cat fur. I've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.82,
      "end_seconds": 124.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.11,
      "end_seconds": 148.38,
      "duration_seconds": 23.27,
      "text": "I mean, I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. Hmm, I do miss it now and then, to be fair. Yeah, um, I'm on telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.12,
      "end_seconds": 152.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.69,
      "end_seconds": 158.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Uh, my mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.81,
      "end_seconds": 177.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.56,
      "end_seconds": 190.28,
      "duration_seconds": 11.72,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago. No, I share a house with my brother. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.28,
      "end_seconds": 206.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.84,
      "end_seconds": 210.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "I've, I've got eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.93,
      "end_seconds": 212.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.28,
      "end_seconds": 217.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.01,
      "end_seconds": 219.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.77,
      "end_seconds": 227.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Just a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.57,
      "end_seconds": 231.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.41,
      "end_seconds": 245.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.16,
      "end_seconds": 262.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 108 over 79, pulse 85, temperature is 36.8 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.49,
      "end_seconds": 269.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.01,
      "end_seconds": 270.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.58,
      "end_seconds": 274.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Alright, breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.14,
      "end_seconds": 292.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "The eczema patches on the arms have yellow crusts and weeping areas."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.89,
      "end_seconds": 316.8,
      "duration_seconds": 21.91,
      "text": "You can relax now. Okay, thinking it through, this is probably eczema with a bacterial skin infection. It could also be herpes simplex eczema, so we'll keep that open. So, to recap quickly. You've had itchy red patches that have gone crusty for about a month, and no high fever or eating poorly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.82,
      "end_seconds": 319.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.55,
      "end_seconds": 335.1,
      "duration_seconds": 13.55,
      "text": "A skin swab is what I'd like next, for infected eczema. You'll be taking flucloxacillin, 250 milligrams, four times a day, seven days. You take it by mouth. That's for infected eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.92,
      "end_seconds": 342.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "How soon will it work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.38,
      "end_seconds": 347.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Keep the nails short and keep using the moisturiser."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.04,
      "end_seconds": 355.39,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "I follow. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.86,
      "end_seconds": 359.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Okay, uh, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.83,
      "end_seconds": 368.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Book a review in one week. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.06,
      "end_seconds": 372.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "That's clear, you know, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.84,
      "end_seconds": 374.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}